  <p id="c-nanshi-058-peizhiti-sixth-brother:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">時<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peizhiti-sixth-brother:p001:m0001" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAA">之高</persName>第六弟<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peizhiti-sixth-brother:p001:m0006" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAC">之悌</persName>在<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peizhiti-sixth-brother:p001:m0009" ref="5d1_8jg_amy">侯景</persName>中。或傳<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peizhiti-sixth-brother:p001:m0015" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAC">之悌</persName>斬<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peizhiti-sixth-brother:p001:m0018" ref="5d1_8jg_amy">侯景</persName>，<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peizhiti-sixth-brother:p001:m0021" ref="rvc_bqx_v5w">元帝</persName>使兼中書舍人<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peizhiti-sixth-brother:p001:m0029" ref="eay_m8c_1bh">黃羅漢</persName>報<persName id="c-nanshi-058-peizhiti-sixth-brother:p001:m0033" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo_AAA">之高</persName>，</p>
